ife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras/d100961e6cf18d1010c7ef4efcd6483d.avif?t=1762871174\" width=400 height=599 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging card game\u2014choose effects, build your deck, and fight for better sales performance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the world of Taiwanese soap operas, with over-the-top drama and traditional local flair, you'll feel like you're living in a primetime melodrama!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in Mandarin, Japanese, and Taiwanese Hokkien\u2014you never imagined erotic scenes could sound <i>this</i> uniquely Taiwanese!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras/3dec49d7db40bf500adf966cf38735af.avif?t=1762871174\" width=600 height=338 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras/ef47d1f839b12b6390c5f905b9996bb7.avif?t=1762871174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras_big/ef47d1f839b12b6390c5f905b9996bb7.avif?t=1762871174 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras/8e38d5f869a928afd4d81d903e3f2a91.avif?t=1762871174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971750/extras_big/8e38d5f869a928afd4d81d903e3f2a91.avif?t=1762871174 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["\u6a39\u61f6\u53eb\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4","Maker\u88fd\u9020\u6a5f"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4